    function_argument_types_unchecked_2026-09-01, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: reproduced on fresh HEAD seed. Seed lane LIVE: doc repro prints A=42 B=6257029261602 exit 0 with no diagnostic (lower_call has only two literal special-case admissions). Pure-Simple lane: literal and variable wrong-typed args already rejected by the HM inferencer, but cross-module calls hit TypeInferError.Undefined and no check ran - infer_module only forward-declared module.functions, never binding imported function symbols present in module.symbols. Fix (src/compiler/30.types/type_infer/inference_control.spl +26): _bind_imported_function_symbols binds imported concrete function symbols into the env by module-local SymbolId; local functions still shadow imports; generic imports stay unbound. Spec test/01_unit/compiler/types/function_argument_types_checked_spec.spl 5/5 PASS (literal/variable/cross-module rejections + two controls); neighbours hm_owned_typed_module_v1 7/7, hm_source_diagnostics 4/4, type_inference_v2 70/70, phase3_global_pool 6/6, nil_into_scalar_slot 4/4, generalize_and_symbol_id_dict 7/7 all PASS - no regressions. Residual: seed lane needs the admission patch (design at build/p3cache/argtypes/seed_argument_admission.patch.design; int-width coercion/newtype carve-outs need stdlib-wide validation per the doc triage); default severity stays Advisory by owner decision. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/types/function_argument_types_checked_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/types/hm_owned_typed_module_v1_spec.spl"

